steps.body:
The notches meet in the middle and together leave one white region:

- the arc of the **left** piece and the round bite of the **top** piece join into a **round head**;
- the thin spike-shaped notch of the **right** piece becomes a **long, narrow beak** pointing right;
- the steps of the left and right pieces and the zigzag of the **bottom** piece bound a **tilted rectangular body**, whose lowest corner sits in the V-shaped dip of the bottom piece.

So the assembled figure is a black square with a white bird-like shape: head, beak to the right, tilted body below.
